yuanme-ncm-math.otf is yuanme NCM Math, the math font the Engine embeds and subsets
for each Site. crates/yuanme-assets/math-font.py builds it; don't edit it by hand.

yuanme NCM Math is New Computer Modern Math Book 8.1.1 by Antonis Tsolomitis,
renamed for yuanme. math-core-fonts (https://github.com/tmke8/math-core-fonts,
commit 2af58a8fcfd0) changed it for MathML in browsers: the primes are their
script-size forms, the accents are centred or lowered in their glyph boxes,
breve and caron are drawn from their combining forms, and U+FE00 variation
sequences are declared on the calligraphic capitals. No other glyph changed, and
no outline was redrawn. The authors of New Computer Modern don't support this
version: report problems to https://github.com/yuann3/yuanme/issues. The
original is at https://ctan.org/pkg/newcomputermodern.

